@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
participant "Tester" as T
participant "DM" as DM
participant "CameraDriver" as CD
participant "Storage" as ST
T -> DM : 0x31 01 02 01 (start)
DM -> CD : Start(...)
CD --> DM : StartOutput (accepted)
DM --> T : 0x71 01 02 01
T -> DM : 0x31 03 02 01 (results)
DM -> CD : RequestResult(...)
CD --> DM : status 0 (running)
DM --> T : 0x71 03 02 01 00
CD -> ST : SetCalibration(CameraExtrinsics, record)
ST --> CD : OK
T -> DM : 0x31 03 02 01
DM -> CD : RequestResult(...)
CD --> DM : status 1 (done)
DM --> T : 0x71 03 02 01 01
@enduml
